  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">220972_Vanuatu Start Fund (Alert 690) Tropical Cyclones Judy and Kevin</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project aims to reach 1000 households (5000 people) on Efate with immediate WASH provisions including bucket (1x per household), and hygiene kits. The Cyclone Response will also repurpose COVID-19 IEC and demonstrations about handwashing, approved by the Ministry of Health, to build on increased awareness about its continued importance.</narrative>
  </description>
